{"kind":"table","sheet":"Instructions","address":"A1:B22","rows":22,"cols":2,"values":[["ZLA Bid-Time Import Template",null],[null,null],[null,null],["Use this workbook to add or update two-hour bidder windows for one area and bid year.",null],[null,null],["Step","What to do"],[1,"Open the Bid Times tab. Keep the column names in row 1 unchanged."],[2,"Enter each bidder's area seniority rank. Initials are optional but help verify the correct bidder."],[3,"Enter Pacific local start times for any rounds you want to add or change. Each window lasts two hours."],[4,"Leave a round cell blank to keep that existing round unchanged. Omitted bidders are also unchanged."],[5,"In the Admin Console, choose the bid year and area, upload this file, review the preview, and import."],[null,null],["Column","Accepted value"],["seniority_rank","Required. The active bidder's rank within the selected area, such as 1, 2, or 48."],["initials","Optional verification value. If supplied, it must match the bidder at that rank."],["round_1_start","Optional Pacific local date/time for Round 1."],["round_2_start","Optional Pacific local date/time for Round 2."],["round_3_start","Optional Pacific local date/time for Round 3."],["round_4_start","Optional Pacific local date/time for Round 4."],[null,null],["Accepted time formats","Excel date/time cells, YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM, or M/D/YYYY H:MM AM/PM."],["Important","Imports never delete omitted bidders or blank rounds, and existing bid-window status is preserved."]]}
